	(text "VIDEO-G 1.0 GFX (hardware/video-g/DESIGN.md): the graphics board of VIDEO-G, on the J4 ribbon from TEXT (which decodes everything)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 12.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f7ba149f-49ae-5b0c-97b7-d27322526f39"))
	(text "CPU window 7C00-7C3F = pixel line Y (written at 7806), bit 7 of byte 0 = leftmost dot. Pages: DPAGE shown, CPAGE written (control at 7804, bits 3, 4)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 15.20 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b0089542-80d6-5fe3-a671-93570b57c3d6"))
	(text "RAM address: display {DPAGE, RA2-RA0, MA10-MA0}, CPU {CPAGE, Y2-Y0, Y7-Y3, A5-A0}; the RAM is shared per character time (no snow)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 18.40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d04c86cc-c153-5c4e-b104-0c1952264653"))
	(text "Mouse: a read of 7806 = the next byte of the 3-byte PS/2 packets; MOUSE-READY on TEXT's status bit 1; reports only while MOUSE-ON." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 21.60 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d2f9a8a6-f85d-5c61-b014-c29e881d7694"))
